":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-11","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/884887/000088488726000007/rcl-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"We are a vacation industry leader, owning and operating three global cruise vacation brands: Royal Caribbean, Celebrity Cruises and Silversea (collectively, our \"Global Brands\"). We also own a 50% joint venture interest in TUI Cruises GmbH (\"TUIC\"), which operates the German brands TUI Cruises and Hapag-Lloyd Cruises (collectively, our \"Partner Brands\"). We account for our investments in our Partner Brands under the equity method of accounting. Together, our Global Brands and our Partner Brands have a combined fleet of 69 ships in the cruise vacation industry with an aggregate capacity of approximately 179,720 berths as of December 31, 2025. Our ships offer a selection of worldwide itineraries that call on more than 1,000 destinations on all seven continents. We also own a growing portfolio of private land-based destinations, including our Perfect Day and Royal Beach Club collections.","zh":"我們是度假產業的領導者，擁有並經營三個全球郵輪度假品牌：皇家加勒比、精緻遊輪和銀海郵輪（統稱為我們的「全球品牌」）。我們也擁有 TUI Cruises GmbH（「TUIC」）50% 的合資權益，該公司經營德國品牌 TUI Cruises 和 Hapag-Lloyd Cruises（統稱為我們的「合作夥伴品牌」）。我們根據權益會計法對合作夥伴品牌的投資進行會計處理。截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，我們的全球品牌和合作夥伴品牌在郵輪度假產業擁有由 69 艘船舶組成的船隊，總容量約為 179,720 個泊位。我們的船舶提供精選的全球航線，途經七大洲 1,000 多個目的地。我們還擁有越來越多的私人陸上目的地組合，包括我們的 Perfect Day 和 Royal Beach Club 系列。"},{"en":"Our competitive edge is grounded in our focus on innovation, best evidenced in the quality and variety of ships in our fleet, our exceptional product offerings and service provided by our dedicated crew, our growing portfolio of private destinations and experiences, the range of itineraries and global destinations tailored to meet diverse guest preferences, and our use and leveraging of technology. By continually reimagining vacation possibilities and investing in the maintenance and enhancement of our fleet, we inspire both new travelers and loyal repeat guests to embark on unforgettable journeys with us.","zh":"我們的競爭優勢植根於我們對創新的關注，這在我們船隊中船舶的品質和種類、我們敬業的船員提供的卓越產品和服務、我們不斷增長的私人目的地和體驗組合、為滿足不同客人喜好而定制的一系列行程和全球目的地以及我們對技術的使用和利用方面得到了最好的證明。透過不斷重新構想度假的可能性並投資於我們機隊的維護和增強，我們激勵新旅客和忠實的回頭客與我們一起踏上難忘的旅程。"},{"en":"The Company was founded in 1968 as a partnership. Its corporate structure has evolved over the years and the current parent corporation, Royal Caribbean Cruises Ltd., was incorporated on July 23, 1985 in the Republic of Liberia under the Business Corporation Act of Liberia.","zh":"該公司成立於 1968 年，是一家合夥企業。其公司結構多年來不斷發展，目前的母公司皇家加勒比遊輪有限公司於 1985 年 7 月 23 日根據利比里亞商業公司法在利比里亞共和國註冊成立。"}],"markets":[{"en":"In an effort to penetrate untapped markets, diversify our consumer base and respond to changing economic and geopolitical market conditions, we continue to seek opportunities to deploy ships to new and stronger markets and itineraries throughout the world. The portability of our ships allows us to deploy our ships to meet demand within our existing and new cruise markets. We make deployment decisions generally 18 to 32 months in advance, with the goal of","zh":"為了打入未開發的市場、使我們的消費者基礎多樣化並應對不斷變化的經濟和地緣政治市場條件，我們繼續尋求機會將船舶部署到世界各地新的、更強大的市場和航線。我們船舶的便攜性使我們能夠部署船舶以滿足現有和新的郵輪市場的需求。我們通常提前 18 至 32 個月做出部署決策，目標是"},{"en":"optimizing the overall profitability of our portfolio. Additionally, the infrastructure investments we have made to create a flexible global sourcing model have made our brands relevant in a number of markets around the world, which allows us to be opportunistic and source the highest yielding guests for our itineraries.","zh":"優化我們投資組合的整體獲利能力。此外，我們為創建靈活的全球採購模式而進行的基礎設施投資使我們的品牌在全球多個市場中具有相關性，這使我們能夠抓住機會，為我們的行程尋找收益最高的客人。"}],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"We compete within the global vacation industry primarily with a number of cruise lines as well as land-based vacation alternatives for consumers' leisure time. These include resorts (including all-inclusive resorts), hotels, internet-based alternative lodging sites, theme parks, sports, nature and sightseeing destinations. Our principal cruise competitors are Carnival Corporation & plc, which owns, among other brands, Aida Cruises, Carnival Cruise Line, Costa Cruises, Cunard Line, Holland America Line, P&O Cruises, Princess Cruises and Seabourn; Disney Cruise Line; MSC Cruises; Norwegian Cruise Line Holdings Ltd, which owns Norwegian Cruise Line, Oceania Cruises, and Regent Seven Seas Cruises; Viking, and Virgin Voyages.","zh":"我們在全球度假產業中主要與多家郵輪公司以及消費者休閒時間的陸上度假選擇競爭。其中包括度假村（包括全包式度假村）、酒店、基於互聯網的替代住宿網站、主題公園、體育、自然和觀光目的地。我們的主要郵輪競爭對手是嘉年華公司，該公司旗下擁有 Aida Cruises、Carnival Cruise Line、Costa Cruises、Cunard Line、Holland America Line、P&O Cruises、Princess Cruises 和 Seabourn 等品牌；迪士尼遊輪公司；地中海郵輪；挪威郵輪郵輪和維京郵輪。"},{"en":"Our mission is to deliver the best vacation experiences responsibly. We continue to prioritize operating strategies that support this mission, working with our various business and community partners as we build toward a more sustainable","zh":"我們的使命是負責任地提供最佳的度假體驗。我們將繼續優先考慮支持這項使命的營運策略，與我們的各個業務和社區合作夥伴合作，努力實現更永續的目標"}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Cruise Itinerary","val":17071000000,"zh":"郵輪行程"},{"name":"Passenger","val":12515000000,"zh":"乘客"},{"name":"Product & Service Other","val":5419000000,"zh":"產品與服務 其他"},{"name":"Port Costs","val":1300000000,"zh":"港口費用"},{"name":"Other Products & Services","val":864000000,"zh":"其他產品和服務"}],"total":17935000000}},"peers":["NCLH","CCL","UAL","DAL","AAL"]}}